{"path":"physics/optics-modern/optics/doppler","title":"多普勒效应（靠近变高）","type":"example","html":"<p>一列火车鸣笛驶向站在路边的观察者（火车做匀速直线运动，笛声频率恒定），观察者听到的笛声音调（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 变高</p>\n<p>B. 变低</p>\n<p>C. 不变</p>\n<p>D. 无法判断</p>\n<ul>\n<li>四个方向速查（记规律就行）：</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>接收频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>波源靠近 / 观察者靠近</td>\n<td>升高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波源远离 / 观察者远离</td>\n<td>降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对静止 / 同向同速</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>注意</strong>：声音的<strong>波速</strong>始终由介质决定（不变！），变的是&quot;接收到的频率&quot;；同样的车轨、波长 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda=\\dfrac{v}{f&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 变小；</li>\n<li>应用：交通测速雷达（反射波频率差）、B 超、天文红移（光源远离 → 频率低 → 谱线向红端移动）；</li>\n<li>风险：波源过观察者一瞬间，音调&quot;高→低&quot;突变（过点后从靠近变远离）；火车速度越接近声速，音调变化越剧烈。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>多普勒效应</strong>：当波源与观察者<strong>相互靠近</strong>时，观察者接收到的频率<strong>增大</strong>（单位时间内接收到的波峰数增加）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>声源靠近观察者：接收频率 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;=\\dfrac{v}{v-v_s}f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span></span></span></span> 声速，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 声源速度，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{s}&lt;v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span></span></span></span>）——分母变小 ⇒ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;&gt;f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span></span></span></span> ⇒ 音调<strong>变高</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：多普勒判断 → <strong>一句口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;靠近音调高（尖），远离音调低（闷）&quot;</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>火车<strong>驶向</strong>观察者 ⇒ 音调变高。<strong>10 秒选 A</strong>。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"一列火车鸣笛驶向站在路边的观察者（火车做匀速直线运动，笛声频率恒定），观察者听到的笛声音调（ ） A. 变高 B. 变低 C. 不变 D. 无法判断 四个方向速查（记规律就行）： 情形 接收频率 波源靠近 / 观察者靠近 升高 波源远离 /","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"基础","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"观察到的频率变化取决于\"相对运动\"（声源靠近观察者或观察者靠近声源都使频率增大）；是\"频率\"不是\"波速\"变（波速由介质决定不变）。","fit":["声源/观察者相对运动判断音调","波速与频率的关系","选填题"],"updated":"Thu Feb 20 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"physics","title":"物理"},{"slug":"optics-modern","title":"光学与近代物理"},{"slug":"optics","title":"光学与近代物理"},{"slug":"doppler","title":"多普勒效应（靠近变高）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"interference-fringes","title":"双缝干涉条纹间距","type":"example"},{"slug":"light-speed","title":"介质中的光速（v=c/n）","type":"example"},{"slug":"nuclear-decay","title":"核反应·半衰期与质能计算（衰变次数/断代/聚变）","type":"example"},{"slug":"optics-modern","title":"光学与近代物理","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"photoelectric-saturation","title":"光电效应·饱和光电流与光强","type":"example"},{"slug":"photoelectric-stop-voltage","title":"光电效应遏止电压（hν−W 心算）","type":"example"},{"slug":"refraction","title":"折射定律与全反射（特殊角组合）","type":"example"},{"slug":"total-reflection","title":"全反射临界角（sinC=1/n）","type":"example"}]}